    21	short geometric ladder of partial sums (T_k = T_0 * 2^k for k=0..log log x),
    22	we may recover S_inf from O(polylog) zeros instead of O(sqrt x).
    23	
    24	The substantive bet: the *correlations* between zeros (Montgomery–Odlyzko
    25	GUE) carry redundant information about the tail. A few zeros plus their
    26	known correlation structure may suffice.
